The ossia score software has been developed partly during 
multiple French public research projects : ANR Virage, ANR OSSIA, SNI i-score, and thanks to our many generous donators.

SCRIME (https://scrime.u-bordeaux.fr/)
LaBRI (https://www.labri.fr)
Blue Yeti (https://www.blueyeti.fr)
GMEA (http://gmea.net/)
celtera (http://celtera.dev/)
Society for Arts and Technology (https://sat.qc.ca/)

